  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to better understand the causes and consequences of          corruption in the health and eduaction sectors, a workshop for        stakeholders from donors, the government and the civil society is     arranged by U4 in Dhaka.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

